\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Unwise admission amplifies the cliff (LAION-200k, $d{=}1024$, hops${=}32$). (a)\nonbreakingspace A 16-KB admission unit generates $3.7\times $ more NAND reads and cuts throughput by $3.6\times $ relative to record admission. (b)\nonbreakingspace Widening synchronous prefetch lowers promotion precision from 82\% to 29\% and throughput from 21.0 to 5.0 QPS; the unchanged 58\% hit rate is omitted.}}{5}{figure.caption.8}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:mot-pathology}{{3}{5}{Unwise admission amplifies the cliff (LAION-200k, $d{=}1024$, hops${=}32$). (a)~A 16-KB admission unit generates $3.7\times $ more NAND reads and cuts throughput by $3.6\times $ relative to record admission. (b)~Widening synchronous prefetch lowers promotion precision from 82\% to 29\% and throughput from 21.0 to 5.0 QPS; the unchanged 58\% hit rate is omitted}{figure.caption.8}{}}
