\newlabel{fig:hide-robustness}{{12}{12}{Critical-path hiding and robustness. (a--b) Demand versus \sys {} at the representative matched-recall point on each dataset. (c) A true-cold run and its immediate warm partner. (d) T2I-10M sensitivity to the CXL-side cache, normalized to the fixed 4\,GiB configuration. Every mark summarizes five runs}{figure.caption.29}{}}
